      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>Kailas Komfort was created to provide comfort to children and adults diagnosed with a rare autoinflammatory bone disease called Chronic Recurrent Multifocal osteomyelitis or CRMO, to bring awareness, and to support families affected by the disease. We ship care packages to kids and adults with CRMO and their families, provide educational materials on CRMO and organize a large awareness event each year.</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>Sent out care packages to 197 children and adults newly diagnosed with CRMO through our care package program; Sent out 64 Uplift care packages to children diagnosed with CRMO going through an extremely difficult time, either physically or mentally; Sent out 149 Pain Care devices to children with CRMO receiving injections/infusions for treatment; Sent out 22 sibling care packages through our Sibling Program; Sent out 29 Parent packages through Family Program; Sent out 220 medals of strength to children with CRMO; Provided education resources to countless families; Organized and hosted the CRMO Awareness 5K which was attended by 632 registrants.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
